    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665780/extras/744c2ef2ff5586fb10bb3d1573d70aba.poster.avif?t=1746417705\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665780/extras/744c2ef2ff5586fb10bb3d1573d70aba.webm?t=1746417705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665780/extras/744c2ef2ff5586fb10bb3d1573d70aba.mp4?t=1746417705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Pop, Subtract, and Score your way to Victory!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Subtracto</strong> is a minimalist number puzzle game where quick thinking and sharp decisions lead to high scores.<br>Click or hold and drag colorful balls to subtract their values from the Main Number, reach zero and score big. But beware! Go below zero and you'll lose precious time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665780/extras/eadf90461e38c7b08f801987a516ea98.poster.avif?t=1746417705\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665780/extras/eadf90461e38c7b08f801987a516ea98.webm?t=1746417705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665780/extras/eadf90461e38c7b08f801987a516ea98.mp4?t=1746417705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >As the challenge escalates,  reach target scores, multiply your score with powerful multipliers and unlock new game sets.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665780/extras/66cb867f6fd5f48066d614b469760e2a.poster.avif?t=1746417705\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665780/extras/66cb867f6fd5f48066d614b469760e2a.webm?t=1746417705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665780/extras/66cb867f6fd5f48066d614b469760e2a.mp4?t=1746417705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >with 3 different modes, Fast, focused, and surprisingly addictive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Subtracto is math made fun.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Controls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keyboard &amp; Mouse, but able to play with Mouse Control Only</p>",
