b_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665780/extras/66cb867f6fd5f48066d614b469760e2a.poster.avif?t=1746417705\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665780/extras/66cb867f6fd5f48066d614b469760e2a.webm?t=1746417705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665780/extras/66cb867f6fd5f48066d614b469760e2a.mp4?t=1746417705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >with 3 different modes, Fast, focused, and surprisingly addictive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Subtracto is math made fun.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Controls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keyboard &amp; Mouse, but able to play with Mouse Control Only</p>",
